; the exports of rasapi32.dll of windows with their ordinals, less the ones that are not here yet.
LIBRARY rasapi32.dll
EXPORTS
    RasConnectionNotificationA @68
    RasConnectionNotificationW @69
    RasEnumConnectionsA @82
    RasEnumConnectionsW @83
    RasEnumEntriesA @86
    RasEnumEntriesW @87
    RasGetConnectStatusA @98
    RasGetConnectStatusW @99
    RasHangUpA @134
    RasHangUpW @135
